            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Denelle Owen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe was great! I couldn't find any bacon cheese spread, so I ended up getting a garlic and herbs cheese spread. I probably used a little more of that than the recipe calls for, but my family likes rich, cheesy food. Everyone said they loved this dish. My husband, said out of everything we had, this was his favorite dish. (and we had plenty of good eats!) I will definitely use this as my green bean casserole recipe from now on."
          },
